{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A new sensation in jumping action soaring through the sky!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Air Master Hanemaru is a jump action game where you control Hanemaru, a creature with small wings, using jumps and glides to avoid falling and reach the goal! With unique controls and a high difficulty level, various stages with changing atmospheres await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/hanemaru4-1.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Flap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you press the button during a jump, Hanemaru flaps its wings and can slightly ascend! If used at the right time, it can help you barely reach platforms or adjust your height, making it an essential action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/habataki.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Glide\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gliding slows your fall speed and allows you to move to distant platforms! It\u2019s especially useful for moving from high places or performing long-distance jumps! You can also fly faster by angling your glide, expanding your movement range significantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/Gride2.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Just Jump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you time your jump perfectly while landing on a platform, the &quot;Just Jump&quot; activates! If you execute it well, you\u2019ll be able to jump higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/justJump2.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Checkpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each stage, a large door awaits! Opening the door starts the next stage! If you make a mistake, you can retry from the checkpoint as long as you have remaining lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/checkpoint3.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Video &amp; Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game can be freely streamed on platforms like YouTube or Twitch. There are no restrictions on monetization. No prior or post-notification is needed.<br>There are no special restrictions on posting on social media.<br>If you include the game name and Steam page URL while streaming or posting videos, it would be appreciated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397780?t=1748572447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/70cbc63876c16d9865d6796b4753582b70c5856b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748572447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/3f413a683179cd98610a37940189545003b31d1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748572447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/3f413a683179cd98610a37940189545003b31d1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748572447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3652430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A new sensation in jumping action soaring through the sky!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Air Master Hanemaru is a jump action game where you control Hanemaru, a creature with small wings, using jumps and glides to avoid falling and reach the goal! With unique controls and a high difficulty level, various stages with changing atmospheres await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/hanemaru4-1.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Flap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you press the button during a jump, Hanemaru flaps its wings and can slightly ascend! If used at the right time, it can help you barely reach platforms or adjust your height, making it an essential action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/habataki.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Glide\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gliding slows your fall speed and allows you to move to distant platforms! It\u2019s especially useful for moving from high places or performing long-distance jumps! You can also fly faster by angling your glide, expanding your movement range significantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/Gride2.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Just Jump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you time your jump perfectly while landing on a platform, the &quot;Just Jump&quot; activates! If you execute it well, you\u2019ll be able to jump higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/justJump2.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Checkpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each stage, a large door awaits! Opening the door starts the next stage! If you make a mistake, you can retry from the checkpoint as long as you have remaining lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/checkpoint3.gif?t=1748572447\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Video &amp; Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game can be freely streamed on platforms like YouTube or Twitch. There are no restrictions on monetization. No prior or post-notification is needed.<br>There are no special restrictions on posting on social media.<br>If you include the game name and Steam page URL while streaming or posting videos, it would be appreciated!</p>","developers":["SE.EED CO.,LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/cc04bf76eef8629833dea240421cbb22eacc14ee/header.jpg?t=1748572447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123877,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123877/movie480.mp4?t=1748572445","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123877/movie_max.mp4?t=1748572445"},"name":"game play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123877/74c6a51dfee7924561cd4275502cb495ebc68f12/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748572445","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123877/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748572445","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123877/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748572445"}}],"name":"Air Master HANEMARU","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor an